---
description: Review-gated PRD-to-code workflow for frontend repositories
alwaysApply: true
---

When working from product requirements, read `.ai-dev/constitution.md` and `.ai-dev/workflow.md` first.

Use `.ai-dev/changes/<change>/status.json` as the state machine. Perform only the current phase and stop at human review gates. Never self-approve a gate.

Require source or repository evidence for material claims. Apply the workflow evidence labels and do not implement unresolved inferences, conflicts, contract gaps, unlocated requirements, backend-owned behavior, or work belonging to another repository.

Preserve existing changes. Implement one approved task at a time. Do not automatically commit, merge, push, or deploy. Run the repository verification commands and update `traceability.md` and `verification.md`.

Before presenting a gate, run:

```bash
node .ai-dev/scripts/validate-change.mjs <change-dir>
```
